Short:        StormC Patch 7
Author:       HAAGE & PARTNER Computer
Uploader:     haage_partner compuserve com (Markus Nerding)
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.0
Requires:     StormC 2.x
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Distribution: AmiNet



Dear StormC customer,

enclosed you will find a patch program to update
StormC version 2.00.2 (24.11.96) to the current release
2.00.4 (07.12.96).

The process is started by a double click on the icon

StormC2.0-2.Patch.BAT


Please take note that the old version of StormC must be in the drawer

StormC:StormSYS


Best wishes

HAAGE&PARTNER Support Team



History of StormC
============================

02.12.96 (V 2.00.03)

* Optimisations of structs assings (of 23.11.96) caused some side effects at
  functions which give back structs.

  -> Example "pi.c" can not be compiled any more.


07.12.96 (V 2.00.04)

* The tricky algorithm of 17.09.96 (because of call of IEEE library functions)
  had a blackout when both arguments of the function call were the same register
  variable (e.g. multiplication of a double variable with itself).

* On the initialisation of a static object with a pointer on another object
  created unnessesare _INIT_ functions.




